Note on data. This licence covers the code and analysis in this repository.
The underlying datasets keep their own terms: NASA GRACE/GRACE-FO, CHIRPS,
WorldPop, JRC GHSL and JRC Global Surface Water are open-access via Google
Earth Engine; BBS census data belongs to the Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics;
boundaries are GADM 4.1 and OCHA COD-AB. See README.md for full citations.
